    "summary": "A woman&#039;s dress; almost ankle length, flared shape, with long, tapered sleeves.  Made of blue woven wool cloth, commercially made.  Single piece of cloth for front; six separate panels at the back.  &#039;V&#039;-shaped centre front opening, with applied red and yellow woven wool cloth.  This decoration extends to the front shoulder seams, the upper back (at the three central seams), the cuffs and hemline.  Green and yellow wool overstitching.  A rectangular metal two-piece clasp fastens neck opening. The clasp made of silvered metal, stamped to imitate faceted gemstones.",
